# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of OS or local git
# config (core.autocrlf). This repo is worked on from both a Windows machine
# and a Mac (see CLAUDE.md "Working across Windows and Mac") -- without this,
# a fresh checkout on Windows converts every tracked text file to CRLF, which
# then shows as a full-file diff noise on the next edit even though nothing
# meaningful changed. Added July 30, 2026 after exactly that happened.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets -- don't run any text/eol normalization on these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
